# "The rocks start cheating": the special types, moving, with a caption.
# Reflective (teal) and armoured read best in a still; teleporting and
# phasing do their thing during the window. ~5s.
seed 11
sim 400
frames 156
fps 30
size 1920 1080
clear
hud off
camera fixed
zoom 70
ship 0 -420 0
asteroid -540 240 reflective r=115 v=18,-6
asteroid 0 330 armoured r=120
asteroid 560 250 teleporting r=110
asteroid -330 -120 phasing r=100 v=-8,12
asteroid 340 -140 tough r=115
text 0 0.74 8 EVERY LEVEL ADDS A NEW WAY TO DIE
